Third-party components in the release artifacts
===============================================

These ship inside the packages and images that carry them, under their own
terms:

  * pgvector                — PostgreSQL License (a package dependency, never
                              vendored)
  * ONNX Runtime            — MIT (postvec-onnxruntime package / embedded image;
                              its license text ships with the bundle)
  * bundled embedding model — see the model package's own LICENSE, NOTICE and
                              SOURCE.json under
                              /usr/share/doc/postvec-model-*/ and
                              /opt/postvec/ninference/models/
